<!DOCTYPE html>

<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Labour Cess Payment Details</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #333;">

<p>Dear Sir/Madam,</p>

<p>
    This is to inform you that the Labour cess payment details for the
    following proposal have been processed. Please find the details below for
    your reference and necessary action.
</p>

<h3>Proposal Details</h3>

<table border="1" cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0" width="100%"
       style="border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Proposal No.</strong></td>
        <td>${proposalNo!'-'}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Date of Submission</strong></td>
        <td>${dateOfSubmission!'-'}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Work Type</strong></td>
        <td>${karyType!'-'}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Establishment / Construction Address</strong></td>
        <td>${sthapnaPata!'-'}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Construction Area</strong></td>
        <td>${constructionArea!'-'}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>ULB Name</strong></td>
        <td>${ulbName!'-'}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>ULB Code</strong></td>
        <td>${ulbCode!'-'}</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<h3>Payment Details</h3>

<table border="1" cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0" width="100%"
       style="border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Estimated Cess Amount</strong></td>
        <td>₹${estimatedCess!'-'}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Cess Amount Paid</strong></td>
        <td>₹${cessAmount!'-'}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Bank Amount</strong></td>
        <td>₹${bankAmount!'-'}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Transaction ID</strong></td>
        <td>${transactionId!'-'}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Transaction Reference No.</strong></td>
        <td>${transactionRefNo!'-'}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Transaction Date</strong></td>
        <td>${transactionDate!'-'}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Receipt No.</strong></td>
        <td>${receiptNo!'-'}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Payment Status</strong></td>
        <td>${status!'-'}</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<p>
    You are requested to kindly verify the above details and take the necessary
    action at your end.
</p>

<p>
    Please find the relevant proposal and payment details for your reference.
</p>

<p>
    Regards,<br>
    Entit CS
</p>

</body>
</html>